Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.12.31-rt45 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.12.31 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.12-rt
  Head SHA1: cb799716312ad02d2fdc2b72a8de78dcedbb9b30


Or to build 3.12.31-rt45 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.12.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.12.31.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.12/patch-3.12.31-rt45.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
